&nbsp;丟垃圾&nbsp;租客皆可使用<br><br>交通鄰近:<br><br>下樓就有全家跟7-11便利商店<br><br>近亞東捷運5分鐘<br><br>公車站牌1分鐘<br><br>愛買&nbsp;新北市立圖書館3分鐘<br><br>南雅夜市8分鐘<br><br>其他:禁寵物</span></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\">看屋不需任何費用&nbsp;免服務費&nbsp;免仲介費</span></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\">屋主自租&nbsp;仲介勿擾&nbsp;謝謝</span></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\"><br>聯絡方式:0926255250&nbsp;陳先生<br><br>Line&nbsp;ID:baian0207（歡迎加Line詢問）</span></p>\r\n附近有便利商店、傳統市場、公園綠地、學校、夜市、醫療機構。"}, "surround": {"title": "周邊配套", "key": "surround", "active": 1, "address": "板橋區南雅南路二段", "lat": "25.0008807", "lng": "121.4528194", "data": [{"name": "交通", "key": "traffic", "children": [{"type": "subway", "name": "亞東醫院站", "distance": 266, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約266公尺"}, {"type": "bus", "name": "光華商職站", "distance": 138, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約138公尺"}, {"type": "bus", "name": "捷運亞東醫院站", "distance": 162, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約162公尺"}]}, {"name": "生活", "key": "live", "children": [{"type": "shop", "name": "複合式商場", "distance": 1101, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約1101公尺"}, {"type": "restaurant", "name": "歐義式 ALL 14 WELL", "distance": 60, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約60公尺"}]}, {"name": "教育", "key": "education", "children": [{"type": "primary", "name": "新北市板橋區中山國民小學", "distance": 474, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約474公尺"}, {"type": "secondary", "name": "新北市立忠孝國民中學", "distance": 956, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約956公尺"}]}]}, "cost": {"title": "費用詳情", "active": 1, "data": [{"name": "租金", "value": "17,000元/月", "key": "rentPrice"}, {"name": "押金", "value": "二個月", "key": "deposit"}, {"name": "電費", "value": "1度5元", "key": "electricFee"}, {"name": "管理費", "value": "無", "key": "manageprice"}, {"name": "租金含", "value": "水費、網路、第四台", "key": "priceContainText"}]}, "information": {"title": "基礎資料", "active": 1, "data": [{"name": "產權登記", "value": "房屋已辦產權登記", "key": "hasCertificate", "alias": "", "cate": 1}, {"name": "法定用途", "value": "見使照", "